@startuml
title Versioned news quality and review
start
:Retain grounded Story Package;
:Write narration, beats and visual draft;
:Normalize shot, overlay and audio plans;
:Search licensed media and bounded previews;
:Batched candidate review or valid cached judgments;
if (Required evidence available?) then (yes)
  :Select and validate full Assets;
  :Reuse or generate changed narration/alignment;
  :Render versioned layered composition;
  :Validate actual video, layout and mixed audio;
  :Bounded per-shot semantic review;
  if (Blocking issue or missing review?) then (yes)
    :Retain artifacts and pending reasons;
    :Targeted revision within cost/request limits;
  else (no)
    :Owner full playback review;
    if (Exact output approved?) then (yes)
      :Publish only enabled eligible variants;
      :Capture capability-aware engagement metrics;
    else (no)
      :Hold or revise without timeout approval;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Hold pending; never fabricate passing evidence;
endif
stop
@enduml